# What Dragons Need (Io, ASL 550): full route to the ending. Character creation: H (Human), M (male), K + name, S/S/C/C/W/I to spend the stat points, D to start. s/d are stat keys, so moves use `go <dir>`.
# The town and the smithy shift, recruitment and warrior training (three bouts with Taren), the ruined fort, Bijorn's Wyrmblood kit, the Mt. Vulcis errands for Corona and the holy-water siege, then the Cathedral roof fight with Elizabeth (Level 18): ironskin before her opening combo, O on blitz/lightning/plague turns and E (counterspelled into Interrupted) otherwise, potions when low.
# Her specials are real-time area blasts on a 3x3 roof grid. `clock:manual` stops the clock so the dodging moves cost nothing and only `tick:1` advances it; `clock:0` (DrainTimers) is back on for the turn-based fight. Kai survives on 0.33 HP, Nimbolus carries him out, and the Recovery room's C is the no-romance ending (DNoRo, `finish`).
